{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-5acd50b1-7c13-42b2-90d2-b3001a916784-3\nfc_58d626b8-bcfa-97cd-9d5c-d418fa3fbb45_1","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"\"setups\"|grok-4.7-high","path":"/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/skils/ai-sdlc/universal/teamlead-gate","glob":"*.json","outputMode":"content","caseInsensitive":false,"headLimit":20,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-5acd50b1-7c13-42b2-90d2-b3001a916784-3\nfc_58d626b8-bcfa-97cd-9d5c-d418fa3fbb45_1","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"\"setups\"|grok-4.7-high","path":"/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/skils/ai-sdlc/universal/teamlead-gate","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/.ai-team/runs/analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025/panel/council/r158":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/skils/ai-sdlc/universal/teamlead-gate/scripts/panel_transports.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":6,"content":"  \"note\": \"Производная таблица транспортов судей панелей (PoL v1). НЕ канон: канон — ~/Мой диск/Context/models.md и ~/Мой диск/skils/panel-backends/references/model-invocation.md (шаблоны argv: §1/§1c claude, §2c agy, §2d muse, §3b cursor-agent, §5 codex, §6 hermes). 16.10.2026: у muse-wonder-1.0 и muse-wonder-full-1.0 снижен reasoning-effort с max до high во всех ролях дефолтного сетапа (в fast до medium); добавлены слоты medium для claude-sonnet-5-5 и gemini-4-argon. При расхождении правится канон, затем эта таблица. stream_format_verified=true только у транспортов, чей формат вывода зафиксирован живым смоуком (см. docstring verify_panel_proof.py). 18.10.2026: для grok-4.7-high оставлен единственный транспорт cursor-agent через прокси :10815 (без droid) и слот возвращён в пулы судей default/fast/quality по директиве владельца. 19.10.2026: транспорт droid (Factory Droid, §12) снят из всех слотов; слот deepseek-v4.1-flash удалён (его единственный транспорт был droid; из ролей Coder/суд [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":186,"content":"    \"grok-4.7-high\": {","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":192,"content":"          \"model_id\": \"grok-4.7-high\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":707,"content":"  \"setups\": {","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":712,"content":"      \"grok-4.7-high\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":720,"content":"      \"grok-4.7-high\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":726,"content":"      \"grok-4.7-high\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":7,"totalMatchedLines":7,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":20}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-5acd50b1-7c13-42b2-90d2-b3001a916784-3\nfc_58d626b8-bcfa-97cd-9d5c-d418fa3fbb45_1","startedAtMs":"1793133299978","completedAtMs":"1793133300177"},"model_call_id":"9d30be9d-896b-4b11-8660-3aae3bf58ba6-7-jnp4","session_id":"5ce69240-bb77-49ac-94a0-984d9f92aacc","timestamp_ms":1793133300275}
